                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>We drop all estimations that have one or more missing components out of these components:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Delivery Duration</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Preparation Buffer</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
