                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>The estimations that we receive do not indicate to which page each session belongs. We therefore have to analytically map them in order to associate each estimation to its respective page in the customer journey.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
