                      </zone>
                    </zone>
                    <zone fixed-size='92' h='5257' id='1319' is-fixed='true' type-v2='layout-basic' w='99166' x='417' y='9485'>
                      <zone fixed-size='110' h='5257' id='1629' is-fixed='true' mode='radiolist' name='Overview - PointPDT - Delta' param='[federated.1xl1wcd1oaj1qw1160mpo0gdo7hf].[none:delta:nk]' show-all='false' show-filter-state='false' type-v2='filter' values='database' w='10326' x='417' y='9485'>
                        <zone-style>
                          <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                          <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                          <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                          <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                          <format attr='margin-right' value='4' />
                          <format attr='margin-bottom' value='4' />
                          <format attr='background-color' value='#d4d4d4' />
                        </zone-style>
                      </zone>
                      <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5257' id='1630' type-v2='text' w='46028' x='10743' y='9485'>
                        <formatted-text>
                          <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>&quot;Delta&quot; stands for the time jump across the User journeys. It is always calculated as the Second page - First Page, e.g. RDP - RLP for the RDP vs. RLP Delta</run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>* Delta in &quot;Non-Absolute Value&quot; means bias. It is the average of the the delta between the pages as is.</run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>For example: The average of the deltas of two sessions,  where one of them is +X and the other is -X is 0.</run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>* Delta in &quot;Absolute Value&quot; means error. It is the average of the the delta between the pages where the delta is always positive.</run>
                          <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                          <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>For example: The average of the absolute value deltas of two sessions,  where one of them is +X and the other is -X is X.</run>
                        </formatted-text>
                        <zone-style>
                          <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                          <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                          <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                          <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                          <format attr='margin-bottom' value='4' />
                          <format attr='margin-left' value='4' />
                          <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
                        </zone-style>
                      </zone>
                      <zone h='5257' id='1631' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='42812' x='56771' y='9485'>
                        <zone fixed-size='40' forceUpdate='true' h='2286' id='1171' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='42812' x='56771' y='9485'>
                          <formatted-text>
                            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>* The report contains the data from the last 60 days until today - 1.</run>
                            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>** There are three time buckets, Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner. Please input the excat the timeframes to define time buckets using only hour format (i.e. </run>
                            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8' underline='true'>hh:00</run>
                            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='8'>).</run>
                          </formatted-text>
                          <zone-style>
                            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                            <format attr='margin-left' value='4' />
