                      </zone>
                      <zone h='5029' id='1900' is-fixed='true' type-v2='layout-basic' w='88854' x='10729' y='14742'>
                        <zone h='5029' id='1898' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='46042' x='10729' y='14742'>
                          <zone fixed-size='1696' forceUpdate='true' h='5029' id='1865' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='46042' x='10729' y='14742'>
                            <formatted-text>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>* When </run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Has Transaction = True</run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>, the aggregations include all the sessions that ended up in transactions and we were able to map corresponding RLP, RDP and CKT pages.</run>
                              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>* When choosing </run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Has Transaction = False</run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>,  the aggregations include all the sessions to which could not find a matching transaction and we were able to map corresponding both RLP and RDP.</run>
                              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>Therefore, RLP estimations that did not &quot;convert&quot; to RDP are not a part of the dashboard at all.</run>
                              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                              <run bold='true' fontsize='8'>* We cannot map CKT page for sessions without transactions. We therefore don&apos;t have CKT estimations when Has Transaction = False.</run>
                            </formatted-text>
                            <zone-style>
                              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                              <format attr='margin-right' value='0' />
